<h2 id="a11y-reachable-title">Reachable click targets</h2>
<p id="a11y-reachable-desc">Fixture: the shapes that must stay quiet — a real button, and a div that declares itself.</p>
<div class="card">
  <button type="button" class="a11y-row" onclick="a11yPick(1)">One</button>
  <div role="button" tabindex="0" class="a11y-row" onclick="a11yPick(2)">Two</div>
  <div class="a11y-row">Just text, no handler</div>
</div>
